---
import AdSenseAd from './AdSenseAd.astro';
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const en = lang === 'en';
const prefix = en ? '/en' : '';
const title = en ? 'Weight Changes in Aging Cats: Body and Muscle Condition' : '熟齡貓體重變化：體態、肌肉狀態與日常觀察';
const faqs = en ? [
  ['What is a healthy weight for a cat?', 'There is no universal kilogram target for every cat. Ask your veterinarian to assess body condition and muscle condition alongside weight and medical history.'],
  ['Why is my older cat losing weight?', 'Unexplained weight loss can have several causes and should not be dismissed as normal aging. Record changes in appetite, thirst, activity, and litter-box habits, and contact your veterinarian.'],
  ['Does obesity make a cat a certain number of years older?', 'No. Weight cannot be converted into biological age or an exact number of years lost. Obesity is a health concern requiring individual assessment, not an aging formula.'],
  ['When should I ask about a weight change?', 'Contact your veterinarian about unexplained or persistent loss or gain, or changes accompanied by other symptoms. Do not wait for a fixed kilogram threshold. Sudden or severe illness needs prompt professional advice.'],
] : [
  ['貓咪的健康體重是多少？', '沒有適用每隻貓的固定公斤目標。請獸醫結合體態、肌肉狀態、體重與病史進行個別評估。'],
  ['熟齡貓為什麼變瘦？', '不明原因的體重下降可能有多種原因，不能直接視為正常老化。記錄食慾、飲水、活動與貓砂盆習慣的變化，並聯絡獸醫。'],
  ['肥胖會讓貓咪老幾歲？', '不能這樣換算。體重不能計算生理年齡或確定少活幾年。肥胖是需要個別評估的健康議題，不是老化公式。'],
  ['體重變化何時該詢問獸醫？', '不明原因或持續的增減，以及伴隨其他症狀的變化，都值得聯絡獸醫，不要等到固定公斤門檻。突然或嚴重的不適應儘快尋求專業協助。'],
];
const sections = en ? [
 ['why-weight-matters','Why the scale is only one part of the picture','A weight reading does not show how much is fat or muscle, or explain why it changed. Compare your cat with its own previous records rather than another breed or a universal “ideal” number. A larger frame is not automatically obesity; a stable weight does not rule out changes in body composition.'],
 ['weight-categories','Body condition, weight trend, and muscle condition','Body condition considers fat coverage and shape; muscle condition considers muscle tissue separately. Ask your veterinary team to show you how they assess both. Human BMI is not a suitable shortcut for cats. A short log can include date, scale used, weight, food offered, appetite, and observations. Use similar weighing conditions where practical and avoid drawing conclusions from a single reading.'],
 ['obesity-risks','Overweight and underweight: individual health context','Excess body fat is a health concern, but it does not establish an earlier senior birthday or a particular lifespan. Weight loss also has multiple possible causes. Do not diagnose diabetes, kidney disease, thyroid disease, or dental problems from the direction of weight change. Avoid sudden restriction or a treatment diet chosen from an online article; ask your veterinarian about a safe plan for this cat.'],
 ['monitoring','Prepare useful observations for a veterinary discussion','Note whether a change is new, persistent, or accompanied by reduced jumping, grooming changes, appetite changes, thirst, or litter-box changes. Photographs and dated records may help you explain the pattern. Ask how often to weigh your cat, what its body and muscle condition mean, and which changes should prompt another call. There is no single kilogram-loss threshold that makes it safe to wait for every cat.'],
] : [
 ['why-weight-matters','體重計只能提供一部分資訊','單次體重無法區分脂肪與肌肉，也不能說明變化原因。以愛貓自己的歷史紀錄比較，比套用其他品種或通用「標準體重」更有意義。骨架較大不等於肥胖；體重穩定也不能排除身體組成的變化。'],
 ['weight-categories','分開觀察體態、體重趨勢與肌肉狀態','體態著重脂肪覆蓋與外觀，肌肉狀態則是另一項評估。請獸醫示範如何觀察兩者，不要用人類 BMI 代替。可記錄日期、使用的磅秤、體重、提供的食物、食慾與日常觀察；盡量在相似條件下量測，不用單次數字自行下診斷。'],
 ['obesity-risks','過重與過瘦：需要個別評估的健康背景','脂肪過多是健康議題，但不能據此決定更早的老年生日或特定壽命。變瘦也可能有多種原因，不應從體重方向自行判定糖尿病、腎臟病、甲狀腺疾病或牙齒問題。不要突然限食，或僅憑網路文章使用治療飲食；請獸醫依愛貓現況安排安全計畫。'],
 ['monitoring','整理適合與獸醫討論的紀錄','留意變化是否新出現、持續，或伴隨跳躍減少、理毛、食慾、飲水與貓砂盆習慣改變。附上日期的紀錄與照片可協助說明趨勢。可詢問量測頻率、體態與肌肉評估代表什麼，以及何時需要再次聯絡；沒有一個適用所有貓的安全等待公斤門檻。'],
];
---
<article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
  <header class="mb-8"><p class="text-sm text-purple-700 mb-3">{en ? 'Cats · Updated October 1, 2026' : '貓咪 · 更新：2026-10-01'}</p><h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4">{title}</h1><p class="text-lg text-slate-600">{en ? 'Body condition and weight trends are useful health context—not a clock that tells you how fast your cat is aging or how long it will live.' : '體態與體重趨勢是健康背景，不是計算愛貓老得多快或還能活多久的時鐘。'}</p></header>
  {!en && <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514888286974-6c03e2ca1dba?w=1200&h=675&fit=crop&fm=webp" alt="室內貓咪休息" class="w-full aspect-video object-cover rounded-2xl mb-8" />}
  <nav aria-label={en ? 'Article contents' : '文章目錄'} class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-5 mb-8"><ul class="space-y-2">{sections.map(([id, heading]) => <li><a class="text-blue-700 underline" href={`#${id}`}>{heading}</a></li>)}</ul></nav>
  <div class="space-y-8">{sections.map(([id, heading, text], i) => <section id={id}><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">{heading}</h2><p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">{text}</p>{!en && (i === 0 || i === 2) && <AdSenseAd format="in-article" />}</section>)}</div>
  <section class="my-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">{en ? 'Age conversion answers a different question' : '年齡換算回答的是另一個問題'}</h2><p class="text-slate-700">{en ? 'The ' : '使用'}<a class="text-blue-700 underline" href={`${prefix}/tools/cat-age-calculator/`}>{en ? 'cat-to-human age estimate' : '貓咪年齡計算機'}</a>{en ? ' uses chronological age, not weight, for an educational comparison and a general age-stage reference. Its senior category is over 10 years regardless of kilograms. Aging is gradual; neither the category nor the estimate assesses health.' : '可查看教育性人類年齡對照與一般年齡階段；模型使用實際年齡，不使用體重。老年分類為超過 10 歲，不因公斤數而改變。老化是漸進過程，階段與估算都不能判斷健康。'}</p></section>
  <section id="faq" class="mb-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">{en ? 'Frequently asked questions' : '常見問題'}</h2>{faqs.map(([q,a]) => <details class="py-3 border-b border-slate-200"><summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600">{q}</summary><p class="text-slate-700 mt-3">{a}</p></details>)}</section>
  <p class="text-slate-700 mb-6">{en ? 'For related observations, see ' : '其他觀察方向見'}<a class="text-blue-700 underline" href={`${prefix}/blog/cat-aging-signs/`}>{en ? 'changes to watch in an older cat' : '貓咪變化觀察指南'}</a>{en ? '; for home adjustments, see ' : '；居家調整見'}<a class="text-blue-700 underline" href={`${prefix}/blog/senior-cat-care/`}>{en ? 'senior cat care' : '熟齡貓日常照護'}</a>{en ? '.' : '。'}</p>
  {en && <p class="text-slate-700 mb-6">Eating changes can also warrant an oral-health discussion. Our <a class="text-blue-700 underline" href="/en/blog/pet-dental-health/">dental-care overview</a> is general background, not an explanation of your cat’s weight loss.</p>}
  <footer class="text-sm text-slate-600 border-t pt-5"><h2 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">{en ? 'Sources and limits' : '來源與限制'}</h2><p><a class="text-blue-700 underline" href="https://www.vet.cornell.edu/departments-centers-and-institutes/cornell-feline-health-center/health-information/feline-health-topics/feeding-your-cat">{en ? 'Cornell: Feeding Your Cat' : 'Cornell：貓咪餵食與體態'}</a> · <a class="text-blue-700 underline" href="https://www.vet.cornell.edu/departments-centers-and-institutes/cornell-feline-health-center/health-information/feline-health-topics/special-needs-senior-cat">{en ? 'Cornell: Senior Cat Care' : 'Cornell：老年貓照護'}</a> · <a class="text-blue-700 underline" href="https://www.aaha.org/resources/2021-aaha-aafp-feline-life-stage-guidelines/feline-life-stage-definitions/">AAHA/AAFP</a> · <a class="text-blue-700 underline" href="https://wsava.org/global-guidelines/global-nutrition-guidelines/">{en ? 'WSAVA body and muscle condition toolkit' : 'WSAVA 體態與肌肉狀態工具'}</a></p><p class="mt-3">{en ? 'General educational information, not diagnosis or a treatment plan. These sources do not support a weight-to-age formula or an exact number of years lost.' : '本文是一般教育資訊，不是診斷或治療計畫。這些來源不支持體重換算年齡的公式，也不支持確定少活幾年。'}</p></footer>
</article>
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({ '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'FAQPage', mainEntity: faqs.map(([name,text])=>({ '@type':'Question', name, acceptedAnswer:{ '@type':'Answer', text } })) })} />
